  "scope": "Native PostgreSQL and MySQL migration Apply on Kubernetes 1.37, two managers, and default 10Mi kubelet logs. A real quota prevented the original Apply publication. After one SQL effect committed while the Pod still reported Running, the original Job and Pod were removed. The controller recorded the exact run Unknown and preserved its metadata copy. Removing the quota allowed a fresh native history result to settle the run through HistoryRead, with no replacement Apply and one SQL effect. This proves recovery of a fully applied migration after Job/Pod loss without a persisted result; it does not prove partial migration recovery, human acknowledgment and fresh approval, or the full minor matrix."
